window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When a young woman vanishes without a trace from a quaint fishing village on the coast of England, only one person knows the truth, but he remains silent allowing the authorities to search for her in vain.</p> <p>Meanwhile, Valerie Crane finds herself transported to the year 1605.</p> <p>Terrified and confused, she turns for help to the Whitfield brothers, who take her in and offer her a home.</p> <p>Both Alexander and Finlay Whitfield fall in love with the mysterious woman, who shows up on their doorstep, creating a love triangle that threatens to consume them all.</p> <p>Valerie must make her choice, deciding between the brother who will lead her down the path of destruction, or one who will give her a love she couldn’t find in her own time.</p>"; 
